   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-new-york/lh_app_new-york_brooklyn_bridge_westend61-FOLF11149_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "View of the Manhattan Bridge surrounded by houses"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "A Perfect Day in New York",
   "size": "EXTRA_LARGE",
   "variant": "HEADLINE"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>20. June 2025 | 2 min read | Till Weisbrod</b>",
   "size": "SMALL",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Flight attendant Till Weisbrod loves traveling in the Big Apple. If you want to experience New York in one day, you can accompany him on his trip and follow his recommendations.</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Morning</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-new-york/lh_app_pancakes_westend61-SBDF000922_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Plate with stacked pancakes and butter on top"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Breakfast by the East River</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>Before breakfast, I take a quick detour to the East River to say hello to the Manhattan skyline</li><li>Clark’s Restaurant, my favorite breakfast spot, is just a short walk away. The diner serves all the classics: pancakes, French toast, or scrambled eggs</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "80 Clark St",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-new-york/lh_app_new-york_ground-zero-memorial_alamy-DD6KEW_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Ground Zero Memorial in New York"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Stroll Through Brooklyn Heights</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>That true New York feeling kicks in when walking across the Brooklyn Bridge: Manhattan lies ahead, and I can spot the Statue of Liberty in the distance</li><li>My tip: on Monday mornings, free same-day tickets for the National September 11 Memorial and Museum are available on their website, starting at 7 a.m.</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "180 Greenwich St",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "spacer",
   "size": "MEDIUM"
  },
  {
