   "size": "MEDIUM"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Afternoon</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-new-york/lh_app_new-york_rockefeller_view_uu09359_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "View from the Rockefeller Centre"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Enjoy the View from Rockefeller Center</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>The view from Rockefeller Center is perfect for that classic New York panorama with the Empire State Building</li><li>The Edge observation deck features a glass wall that curves outward for a thrilling, unobstructed view downward</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Edge, 30 Hudson Yards",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Hot Dogs and a Ferry Ride</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>For lunch, I grab a quick hot dog from one of the food trucks</li><li>If the weather’s nice, I hop on the Staten Island Ferry to get up close to the Statue of Liberty – it’s free!</li><li>Travel hack: a visit to Ellis Island is packed with fascinating stories about immigration history and the construction of Lady Liberty</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Whitehall Terminal, 4 Whitehall St",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Evening</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "url": "https://www.lufthansa.com/content/dam/lh/article-images/mobile-app/north-america/a-perfect-day-in-new-york/lh_app_new-york_cocktail_westend61-LHPF00335_1920x1080.jpg.transform/lh-dcep-transform-width-1440/img.jpg",
   "contentDescription": "Hand holding cocktail in a rooftop bar in New York at sunset"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Dinner at Time Out Market</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>Some of the city’s trendiest restaurants have food stands at the Time Out Market</li><li>There’s always something going on here – from salsa classes to DJ sets</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "55 Water St",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>Drinks at the Refinery Hotel</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<ul><li>If I’m still in the mood for a drink, I head to the Refinery Hotel: its small rooftop bar has a view of the Empire State Building</li><li>You really can’t fit more New York into one day!</li></ul>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "63 W 38th St",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Copyrights: Westend61, Alamy",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "<b>About</b>",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
  {
   "type": "copyText",
   "text": "Till Weisbrod has been working for Lufthansa since 2015. He frequently flies to Asia and North America.",
   "size": "MEDIUM",
   "variant": "BODY"
  },
